{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention wormie enjoyers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to start your own worm shop? Then wormies is the game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.poster.avif?t=1774641163\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.webm?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.mp4?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, breed, and discover hundreds of unique wormies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your wormies cookies to make them happy! Happy wormies will breed with other happy wormies to produce new combos, from basic to elusive, rare wormies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9e606ae81a64c94d17ed4e0b4527208c.poster.avif?t=1774641163\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9e606ae81a64c94d17ed4e0b4527208c.webm?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9e606ae81a64c94d17ed4e0b4527208c.mp4?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your wormie collection! Whether you sell or keep them, it\u2019s up to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/fe345e4c85d96a62b2f97e8672454a4f.poster.avif?t=1774641163\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/fe345e4c85d96a62b2f97e8672454a4f.webm?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/fe345e4c85d96a62b2f97e8672454a4f.mp4?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your returning customers as you fulfil their orders, then spend your hard earned profits on decorating and customizing your favourite wormies and their environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/7feee190394cae49060f9632e7f00a55.poster.avif?t=1774641163\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/7feee190394cae49060f9632e7f00a55.webm?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/7feee190394cae49060f9632e7f00a55.mp4?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed and discover hundreds of unique wormies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill orders and get to know your customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through various customer storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your profits to unlock upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your wormies and their environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, you can pet the wormies!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058290?t=1774641163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058290?t=1774641163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/13c59af24fa8459a06876d6a0ddd9d3adf83f2c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774641163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/13c59af24fa8459a06876d6a0ddd9d3adf83f2c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774641163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention wormie enjoyers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to start your own worm shop? Then wormies is the game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.poster.avif?t=1774641163\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.webm?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058290/extras/9170f87d71494b167f80faa616eaf4a8.mp4?t=1774641163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, breed, and discover hundreds of unique wormies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your wormies cookies to make them happy! Happy wormies will breed with other happy wormies to produce new combos, from basic to elusive, rare wormies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=